      "side": 1,
      "message": "The issue I encountered was on Wilco.  The first factory boot called ccd_reset_config() which then called HOOK_CCD_CHANGE.  Wilco specific code performs a ccd_get() to read the factory mode flag.  However because the ccd_config_loaded flag was still 0, ccd_get() returned 0 for the factory mode flag.  The original code only set the ccd_config_loaded after ccd_reset_config() returned.\n\nThis change delays the first HOOK_CCD_CHANGE until after the ccd_config_loaded flag is set.",
